    "detailed_description": "**Game Features**<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Over a hundred cute rabbits<br />\r\n- 24 levels<br />\r\n- Adjustable puzzle difficulty<br />\r\n- Immersive puzzle experience<br />\r\n- Relaxing background music<br />\r\n<br />\r\n**Game Controls**<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Left mouse button: Hold to move the puzzle piece<br />\r\n- Right mouse button: Click to rotate the puzzle piece<br />\r\n- R key: Rotate the held puzzle piece<br />\r\n- Q key: Toggle the game UI on/off<br />\r\n- In settings: Toggle the grid lines on the level background<br />\r\n- In settings: Toggle the hint function on/off<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---",
